WEBVTT

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:10.010
( Watch on kissasia.biz or asiankh.org )

00:03:00.935 --> 00:03:02.728
Give it to me.

00:03:02.729 --> 00:03:03.771
Just give it to me.

00:03:03.772 --> 00:03:04.813
Gido, here.

00:03:04.814 --> 00:03:05.981
Don’t try to talk me down, Gido.

00:03:05.982 --> 00:03:07.262
We’re just trying to break even.

00:03:07.525 --> 00:03:10.618
I’m already taking ten kilos. That should make up for it!

00:03:10.695 --> 00:03:11.988
Fine. I’ll give it to you.

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:13.197
Mine’s twelve, okay?

00:03:13.198 --> 00:03:14.823
I should be getting a bigger discount.

00:03:14.824 --> 00:03:16.700
Let me ask Celia first if that’s okay. Just come back later.

00:03:16.701 --> 00:03:18.119
Thank you, Anton.

00:03:25.251 --> 00:03:27.754
Miguel’s one lucky guy to have Isla.

00:03:27.812 --> 00:03:30.190
- She’s gorgeous. - I heard...

00:03:30.215 --> 00:03:33.176
Okay, hold on. Enough fooling around— Where’s the rent money?

00:03:33.443 --> 00:03:36.738
Hey, it’s Isla. She always has to show off.

00:03:36.763 --> 00:03:38.598
Such an attention seeker, huh?

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:42.936
You know what, girl? Thank God we’re not like that, huh?

00:03:42.977 --> 00:03:45.188
She’s way too desperate for a man’s attention.

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:49.901
Ugh… she always has to be the center of attention.

00:03:51.402 --> 00:03:52.821
Hi, Isla.

00:03:53.329 --> 00:03:54.349
Lumeng.

00:04:10.255 --> 00:04:11.296
Isla.

00:04:11.840 --> 00:04:12.859
Isla!

00:04:13.981 --> 00:04:15.283
What are you doing here?

00:04:15.885 --> 00:04:16.920
Go home.

00:04:18.641 --> 00:04:20.517
Your mom’s been looking for you.

00:04:20.932 --> 00:04:22.142
I’m waiting for someone.

00:04:22.809 --> 00:04:23.842
What?

00:04:24.607 --> 00:04:25.636
Who?

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:26.777
Just someone.

00:04:30.541 --> 00:04:31.865
Oh, Isla…

00:04:33.486 --> 00:04:34.892
You’re so stubborn.

00:04:35.095 --> 00:04:38.056
Don’t make Celia come get you herself.

00:04:40.326 --> 00:04:42.217
I’m not scared of my mom.

00:04:43.997 --> 00:04:45.676
Let them both come get me.

00:04:47.578 --> 00:04:48.663
Just go home.

00:04:50.409 --> 00:04:51.443
I don’t want to.

00:04:55.842 --> 00:04:56.926
You’re acting like a child.

00:05:07.604 --> 00:05:08.645
This fish is really good.

00:05:08.646 --> 00:05:10.006
I did a pretty good job with this.

00:05:10.433 --> 00:05:12.560
Hey, where have you been? It’s late!

00:05:13.151 --> 00:05:14.569
I was just around, Mom.

00:05:14.613 --> 00:05:16.240
Where exactly?

00:05:16.455 --> 00:05:18.249
Just by the shore, Mom.

00:05:19.232 --> 00:05:21.150
I ran into Liza.

00:05:21.926 --> 00:05:23.326
I thought you two didn’t get along.

00:05:23.661 --> 00:05:24.754
We made up.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.335
- Come eat with us. - Hey!

00:05:31.169 --> 00:05:32.378
Where are you going?

00:05:32.545 --> 00:05:34.325
At least say ‘hi’ to your father.

00:05:35.606 --> 00:05:36.606
Go on.

00:05:39.716 --> 00:05:41.386
Come on, have some.

00:05:54.451 --> 00:05:56.571
Looks like you’ve been with your boyfriend again, huh?

00:05:58.821 --> 00:06:00.280
Hey, Isla.

00:06:00.281 --> 00:06:01.373
Be careful.

00:06:01.528 --> 00:06:03.655
You’re gonna end up pregnant if you keep this up.

00:06:04.538 --> 00:06:06.749
Jeez, Mom. Me? Pregnant?

00:06:06.996 --> 00:06:08.385
That’s a bit much.

00:06:08.442 --> 00:06:09.698
I’m telling you...

00:06:09.958 --> 00:06:12.377
Don’t go off alone with him, okay?

00:06:13.152 --> 00:06:15.279
Just listen to your mom, Isla.

00:06:17.632 --> 00:06:19.884
What’s your problem with Miguel?

00:06:20.301 --> 00:06:22.345
He hasn’t done anything wrong.

00:06:22.804 --> 00:06:25.556
We’ve heard some pretty bad things about Miguel.

00:06:25.581 --> 00:06:28.543
You even got into a fight with Liza because of him.

00:06:30.771 --> 00:06:31.820
For God’s sake…

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:36.951
You guys always believe everything you hear!

00:06:41.732 --> 00:06:44.212
Where do you think you’re going? We’re not done talking to you!

00:06:47.745 --> 00:06:48.955
This child...

00:06:51.249 --> 00:06:52.708
Where are you going?

00:06:52.709 --> 00:06:54.210
- We’re still talking. - To Lumeng’s.

00:06:56.004 --> 00:06:58.370
That girl… she’s turning into such a brat.

00:06:58.395 --> 00:06:59.395
Just let her be.

00:06:59.788 --> 00:07:00.788
She’s at that age.

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:11.019
Anton?

00:08:12.768 --> 00:08:14.063
Anton?

00:08:34.769 --> 00:08:36.169
Isla might wake up…

00:08:40.542 --> 00:08:41.598
Not now.

00:08:42.591 --> 00:08:43.885
She won’t.

00:12:03.728 --> 00:12:04.937
What took you so long?

00:12:05.521 --> 00:12:08.118
I had to wait for my mom to fall asleep.

00:12:10.711 --> 00:12:12.210
I’m going to Manila.

00:12:12.945 --> 00:12:13.988
Really?

00:12:15.861 --> 00:12:17.029
I’ll come with you.

00:12:18.701 --> 00:12:19.701
When?

00:12:19.726 --> 00:12:20.741
This Sunday.

00:12:21.597 --> 00:12:23.222
I’ve already talked to my dad.

00:12:23.333 --> 00:12:25.680
I’ll be staying with them in Malabon for now.

00:12:25.921 --> 00:12:29.132
While I’m there, I’ll look for a job.

00:12:29.795 --> 00:12:31.130
Take me with you.

00:12:36.090 --> 00:12:39.051
You know I’ve always dreamed of getting out of here, right?

00:12:39.697 --> 00:12:41.420
I’ll take any job.

00:12:41.617 --> 00:12:43.542
I’ll be a waitress, sales lady...

00:12:43.567 --> 00:12:46.528
I’ll sell fish at the market—anything.

00:12:47.563 --> 00:12:48.833
Isla...

00:12:53.276 --> 00:12:54.962
It’s not easy working there.

00:12:56.072 --> 00:12:57.638
I don’t know if you can handle it.

00:12:59.014 --> 00:13:02.143
Miguel, you know I’ve always dreamed of getting out of here, right?

00:13:06.325 --> 00:13:09.494
It’s fine. I’ll do anything just to get out of here.

00:13:12.797 --> 00:13:13.797
Really?

00:13:18.302 --> 00:13:19.302
Miguel, wait.

00:13:20.473 --> 00:13:21.473
What?

00:13:21.597 --> 00:13:23.526
This is my first time… I’m not ready yet.

00:13:23.683 --> 00:13:24.683
You don’t want to?

00:13:25.986 --> 00:13:26.986
Don’t be afraid.

00:13:28.938 --> 00:13:30.855
Isla. Don’t be afraid.

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:32.142
I promise you...

00:13:32.817 --> 00:13:34.110
I’ll be gentle.

00:14:46.891 --> 00:14:48.559
Miguel...

00:14:48.726 --> 00:14:50.269
Take it slow.

00:14:59.956 --> 00:15:00.956
Wait!

00:15:01.524 --> 00:15:02.524
Miguel.

00:15:12.380 --> 00:15:14.089
It hurts, Miguel.

00:15:14.211 --> 00:15:15.379
I got you.

00:15:17.624 --> 00:15:18.724
I got you.

00:15:19.854 --> 00:15:20.854
Miguel...

00:15:32.353 --> 00:15:33.604
It hurts...

00:15:33.813 --> 00:15:34.813
Feels good?

00:15:34.980 --> 00:15:36.357
Miguel, it hurts.

00:15:37.024 --> 00:15:38.192
Feels good, isn’t it?

00:15:41.781 --> 00:15:43.158
It feels good.

00:16:47.344 --> 00:16:48.344
Wait!

00:16:49.096 --> 00:16:50.096
I’m close.

00:17:33.261 --> 00:17:34.602
Oh, Isla.

00:17:36.876 --> 00:17:37.882
Mom...

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:42.524
What? You have something to say?

00:17:45.152 --> 00:17:46.528
Mom, do you love me?

00:17:50.388 --> 00:17:51.598
Oh, Isla...

00:17:51.833 --> 00:17:53.460
What kind of question is that?

00:17:54.032 --> 00:17:55.534
Of course, I love you.

00:18:00.499 --> 00:18:01.899
More than Anton?

00:18:15.307 --> 00:18:16.892
Why the need to compare?

00:18:18.477 --> 00:18:19.812
I love you both.

00:18:23.399 --> 00:18:24.566
You know...

00:18:25.150 --> 00:18:27.444
Ever since Anton came in to our lives,

00:18:27.569 --> 00:18:29.163
everything’s been easier.

00:18:32.449 --> 00:18:33.449
Mom...

00:18:34.695 --> 00:18:35.695
What?

00:18:38.038 --> 00:18:40.541
You know where he came from, right?

00:18:42.629 --> 00:18:44.714
What? When he was imprisoned?

00:18:46.088 --> 00:18:47.088
Honey...

00:18:48.298 --> 00:18:51.260
Everyone can change.

00:18:51.698 --> 00:18:54.492
And ever since your dad died…

00:18:54.638 --> 00:18:56.724
I didn’t have anyone to lean on anymore.

00:18:57.683 --> 00:18:59.604
You know these fish farms of ours?

00:19:00.894 --> 00:19:02.938
They really took off because of Anton.

00:19:05.107 --> 00:19:06.650
That’s why I love him so much.

00:19:13.741 --> 00:19:14.741
Mom...

00:19:15.539 --> 00:19:16.624
What now?

00:19:17.077 --> 00:19:19.705
Anton touched me last night.

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:22.411
Where did he touch you?

00:19:23.917 --> 00:19:24.918
My body…

00:19:33.886 --> 00:19:35.661
He was probably just being nice to you.

00:19:36.722 --> 00:19:40.432
He pretty much treats you like his own daughter.

00:19:43.312 --> 00:19:45.272
We love you so much.

00:19:45.689 --> 00:19:48.025
We don’t even want a mosquito to bite you.

00:19:50.955 --> 00:19:52.406
Isla, please.

00:19:54.156 --> 00:19:55.916
Don’t think that way.

00:19:57.785 --> 00:19:58.984
That’s nonsense.

00:20:39.701 --> 00:20:40.702
What took you so long?

00:20:43.372 --> 00:20:46.024
I told Anton about you and Isla.

00:20:47.167 --> 00:20:48.167
Say what?

00:20:48.752 --> 00:20:50.018
Why would you do that?

00:20:52.172 --> 00:20:53.252
- Oh, come on. - You know...

00:20:53.674 --> 00:20:57.312
You know Anton’s gonna kill me if he finds out.

00:20:58.487 --> 00:21:02.116
Looks like you’re not going to Manila with your girlfriend after all.

00:21:02.516 --> 00:21:04.393
Her dad’s watching her like a hawk now.

00:21:05.185 --> 00:21:07.753
I never said I was taking Isla to Manila.

00:21:08.355 --> 00:21:10.065
Yeah, right. Like I’d believe you.

00:21:11.483 --> 00:21:12.776
Just admit it.

00:21:13.944 --> 00:21:15.238
You two hooked up, didn’t you?

00:21:16.321 --> 00:21:17.481
That’s none of your business.

00:21:18.490 --> 00:21:19.490
Well...

00:21:19.867 --> 00:21:22.347
If all you want from her is her body,

00:21:22.911 --> 00:21:24.204
then why not me?

00:21:25.747 --> 00:21:26.915
Give me that!

00:21:37.837 --> 00:21:40.137
Liza, what the hell are you doing?

00:21:42.806 --> 00:21:43.806
What are you doing?

00:27:42.827 --> 00:27:43.827
Dad.

00:27:45.236 --> 00:27:46.236
Shh...

00:27:57.216 --> 00:27:58.417
When you were little,

00:27:59.474 --> 00:28:01.686
you used to love it when I bathed you.

00:28:02.637 --> 00:28:03.869
Now that you’re all grown up,

00:28:03.894 --> 00:28:05.189
you’ve been so distant.

00:28:06.429 --> 00:28:07.804
You’ve really changed.

00:28:12.190 --> 00:28:14.943
Why? You think I’m still that same naive little girl?

00:28:17.933 --> 00:28:19.143
The Isla I knew...

00:28:20.422 --> 00:28:23.322
was such a sweet, obedient girl.

00:28:46.741 --> 00:28:49.854
Anton? Can you help me with these? Where are you?

00:28:49.879 --> 00:28:51.717
Coming. Just a second.

00:28:54.253 --> 00:28:57.215
I heard your boyfriend left you for someone else.

00:29:23.725 --> 00:29:24.809
Miguel?

00:29:27.187 --> 00:29:28.480
Is Miguel there?

00:29:30.732 --> 00:29:31.732
Why?

00:29:31.775 --> 00:29:33.234
He said...

00:29:33.259 --> 00:29:34.862
He already left for Manila.

00:29:35.112 --> 00:29:36.552
What? You’re planning to follow him?

00:29:36.738 --> 00:29:39.699
Stay away from my son, Isla!

00:29:40.089 --> 00:29:43.401
He has a whole future ahead of him, and you’re not in it.

00:29:43.803 --> 00:29:46.764
Now, get out of here!

00:29:57.592 --> 00:29:59.844
Oh, Liza, honey. You’re up already.

00:29:59.904 --> 00:30:02.864
I made breakfast. Come on, let’s eat.

00:30:02.965 --> 00:30:04.756
Yes, ma’am. I’ll be right there.

00:30:04.781 --> 00:30:07.742
- Alright, I’ll be waiting for you. - Okay. Thank you.

00:30:16.861 --> 00:30:18.112
You know...

00:30:18.113 --> 00:30:19.905
You’ve always been the one everyone had to fuss over,

00:30:19.906 --> 00:30:21.658
even when we were kids.

00:30:21.866 --> 00:30:24.452
They say you’re the most beautiful girl on the island.

00:30:25.286 --> 00:30:27.778
But what good is being pretty...

00:30:27.803 --> 00:30:29.805
If you’re dumb as a rock?

00:30:31.751 --> 00:30:32.919
Poor thing.

00:31:02.660 --> 00:31:03.815
Something bothering you?

00:31:04.885 --> 00:31:06.053
Roldan!

00:31:06.286 --> 00:31:07.286
How are you?

00:31:07.845 --> 00:31:09.689
I thought you’d never come back…

00:31:10.957 --> 00:31:12.317
Were you getting tired of waiting?

00:31:12.457 --> 00:31:14.208
I thought you’d forgotten about me.

00:31:14.233 --> 00:31:15.372
Of course not.

00:31:15.626 --> 00:31:17.464
Look, I even brought you some gifts.

00:31:23.553 --> 00:31:25.847
I know you’ve always wanted to ride the Ferris wheel.

00:31:26.472 --> 00:31:27.472
Wow!

00:31:28.454 --> 00:31:29.574
Oh, and I got you this, too.

00:31:31.436 --> 00:31:32.983
And this is for all your stories.

00:31:36.754 --> 00:31:37.880
Thank you.

00:31:38.234 --> 00:31:41.671
But you know, Roldan, I spend every day looking out at the ocean.

00:31:41.696 --> 00:31:44.991
Hoping you’d come back on one of the boats.

00:31:46.117 --> 00:31:47.274
I’m here now.

00:31:49.537 --> 00:31:50.580
Good.

00:31:50.869 --> 00:31:52.495
I need a friend…

00:31:52.624 --> 00:31:54.506
I’ve got so much to tell you…

00:31:54.737 --> 00:31:57.733
Sounds like we’ve got a lot to talk about.

00:32:04.803 --> 00:32:06.137
I’m heading out, okay?

00:32:06.252 --> 00:32:09.212
I’m just going to a friend’s wake.

00:32:09.237 --> 00:32:10.864
On the island next to ours.

00:32:11.309 --> 00:32:13.812
- Mom— - I’ll spend the night there, too.

00:32:13.978 --> 00:32:15.618
Take care of things while I’m gone, okay?

00:32:15.814 --> 00:32:17.607
Mom, let me come with you.

00:32:19.222 --> 00:32:20.251
No, stay here.

00:32:20.276 --> 00:32:23.070
- Mom, please! - Just stay here with your dad, Anton.

00:32:23.095 --> 00:32:24.998
Knowing him, he’ll be drunk again later.

00:32:25.419 --> 00:32:26.598
Keep an eye on him, okay?

00:32:27.575 --> 00:32:30.537
Mom, please! Let me come with you!

00:32:30.745 --> 00:32:32.579
No, no. I’m leaving.

00:32:32.721 --> 00:32:33.805
It’s getting dark.

00:32:34.040 --> 00:32:35.280
It’s hard to get there by boat.

00:32:39.003 --> 00:32:40.003
Mom.

00:32:51.516 --> 00:32:53.142
Roldan? Lumeng?

00:32:55.703 --> 00:32:57.872
- Isla. - Isla, what brings you by?

00:32:57.897 --> 00:32:59.357
Come on, I brought food. Let’s eat.

00:33:00.900 --> 00:33:03.113
Mom made some pancit.

00:33:03.138 --> 00:33:04.765
Wow, that looks good.

00:33:05.005 --> 00:33:06.881
- Thank you! - She made it for the wake,

00:33:06.906 --> 00:33:08.717
but there was too much, so I brought some for you guys.

00:33:08.741 --> 00:33:10.576
Thanks. Let me grab some plates.

00:33:10.601 --> 00:33:11.727
- Okay. - Excuse me.

00:33:14.372 --> 00:33:17.682
By the way, have you heard?

00:33:18.084 --> 00:33:20.712
I heard Liza moved in with Miguel.

00:33:20.837 --> 00:33:23.798
There. The old hag’s over the moon.

00:33:24.299 --> 00:33:26.467
Of course. She’s moving up in the world.

00:33:26.759 --> 00:33:29.721
But wait, aren’t you dating Miguel?

00:33:31.472 --> 00:33:34.171
Liza really didn’t waste any time.

00:33:34.737 --> 00:33:37.680
Miguel didn’t waste any time finding someone new…

00:33:38.187 --> 00:33:39.187
Jeez…

00:33:40.859 --> 00:33:42.188
Come on. Let’s eat.

00:33:50.167 --> 00:33:52.646
You didn’t even get us anything to drink?

00:33:52.744 --> 00:33:55.008
Hang on. I’ll go get us something to drink.

00:34:00.793 --> 00:34:01.963
This looks good, huh?

00:34:06.633 --> 00:34:07.759
Roldan.

00:34:08.718 --> 00:34:12.889
Anton’s still at home. It’s just the two of us there…

00:34:13.076 --> 00:34:14.076
What?

00:34:14.474 --> 00:34:15.771
Where’s Celia?

00:34:16.559 --> 00:34:18.045
She’s on the other island.

00:34:18.686 --> 00:34:20.489
Do you want to just stay here tonight?

00:34:20.688 --> 00:34:23.650
He’s leaving for Manila early tomorrow morning.

00:34:24.150 --> 00:34:25.650
If anything happens,

00:34:26.011 --> 00:34:27.363
come straight here.

00:34:29.702 --> 00:34:31.161
Thank you, Roldan.

00:34:58.101 --> 00:34:59.101
Where did you get that?

00:35:00.728 --> 00:35:01.728
I bought it.

00:35:51.904 --> 00:35:53.740
I’m telling Mom!

00:35:54.115 --> 00:35:57.076
Try it, and I’ll kill you both.

00:36:09.130 --> 00:36:11.174
Isn’t this what you’ve wanted all along?

00:36:13.217 --> 00:36:15.553
I’ll give it to you if you take me to Manila.

00:36:17.013 --> 00:36:19.306
I grew up in Manila, but I like it here.

00:36:19.360 --> 00:36:21.904
You’re dying to go to Manila…

00:36:22.151 --> 00:36:23.444
What are you gonna do there?

00:36:24.687 --> 00:36:26.314
There’s a lot I can do.

00:36:26.981 --> 00:36:28.024
I know.

00:36:28.232 --> 00:36:29.992
You must be running away from something, huh?

00:36:30.902 --> 00:36:32.779
You can’t do it with me around.

00:36:38.117 --> 00:36:39.160
But this?

00:36:40.787 --> 00:36:42.667
You’ve wanted this for a long time, haven’t you?

00:36:52.725 --> 00:36:54.833
Fine. I’ll take you with me.

00:39:47.515 --> 00:39:48.515
Mom?

00:39:49.475 --> 00:39:50.475
Mom?

00:39:51.602 --> 00:39:53.103
Mom, you’re here already.

00:39:53.187 --> 00:39:54.521
Where’s Anton?

00:39:56.065 --> 00:39:58.025
He already left for Manila. Why?

00:40:00.164 --> 00:40:01.705
Have some. Hey!

00:40:02.085 --> 00:40:03.753
He’ll be back! What’s with you?

00:40:40.496 --> 00:40:43.772
I thought I’d find you here.

00:40:52.038 --> 00:40:53.855
I’ve had enough of this island.

00:40:55.082 --> 00:40:56.167
What happened?

00:40:57.232 --> 00:40:59.096
All the girls hate me.

00:41:00.880 --> 00:41:02.256
All the men...

00:41:02.998 --> 00:41:04.386
They just use me…

00:41:04.975 --> 00:41:06.328
They’re all jerks...

00:41:06.969 --> 00:41:08.137
What do you mean?

00:41:10.848 --> 00:41:12.555
Anton played me.

00:41:13.476 --> 00:41:15.061
I gave him what he wanted…

00:41:16.650 --> 00:41:18.171
But he still went without me.

00:41:19.440 --> 00:41:21.192
Shit. They’re both the same.

00:41:23.444 --> 00:41:24.653
Assholes.

00:41:26.197 --> 00:41:28.199
I told you, you don’t have to deal with this alone.

00:41:28.991 --> 00:41:30.159
I’m here.

00:41:31.035 --> 00:41:32.035
Me and Lumeng.

00:41:33.454 --> 00:41:35.581
You don’t understand what I’m going through.

00:41:36.248 --> 00:41:37.273
Come on, tell me.

00:41:38.459 --> 00:41:39.919
We’ll tell your mom.

00:41:41.295 --> 00:41:43.589
She doesn’t listen to me.

00:41:44.465 --> 00:41:46.217
She’s too blind to see it.

00:41:46.926 --> 00:41:48.594
And there’s something else, Roldan.

00:41:51.203 --> 00:41:53.138
Anton’s going to kill us.

00:41:54.709 --> 00:41:56.586
I know he’s capable of it.

00:41:57.466 --> 00:41:58.943
He used to be a criminal.

00:42:04.527 --> 00:42:06.112
So there’s only one way…

00:42:07.488 --> 00:42:09.685
I need to get out of here.

00:42:13.327 --> 00:42:15.204
I’m so sick of this place.

00:42:19.161 --> 00:42:21.413
I want to get out of this hellhole.

00:42:22.169 --> 00:42:23.629
I’ve done everything.

00:42:26.382 --> 00:42:29.343
I can’t stand being here anymore.

00:42:31.720 --> 00:42:32.972
I’ll help you.

00:42:34.765 --> 00:42:37.059
We’ll find a way to get you out of here.

00:42:37.435 --> 00:42:38.894
Really?

00:42:40.020 --> 00:42:41.147
I promise.

00:42:42.189 --> 00:42:43.373
I promise.

00:42:54.493 --> 00:42:56.537
How was your meeting?

00:42:57.329 --> 00:42:59.081
It went well. I talked to Miguel already.

00:42:59.665 --> 00:43:03.752
We’ll be taking care of the wedding. They’re holding it here.

00:43:05.045 --> 00:43:06.045
Oh.

00:43:07.131 --> 00:43:09.675
Then why do you have to meet in Malabon?

00:43:12.178 --> 00:43:13.608
Don’t you trust your husband?

00:43:19.943 --> 00:43:21.019
What is this?

00:43:27.693 --> 00:43:28.986
Oh, wait.

00:43:29.369 --> 00:43:31.121
I better check the food before it burns.

00:43:34.459 --> 00:43:37.518
Isla, you can handle all the challenges that will come.

00:43:37.616 --> 00:43:39.269
The Lord will guide you.

00:43:45.040 --> 00:43:47.293
Anton's been trying for a while.

00:43:48.128 --> 00:43:51.916
I can't do anything because mom will choose his side over mine.

00:43:52.860 --> 00:43:55.036
I'm so disgusted with him.

00:43:59.366 --> 00:44:01.026
I gave in to Anton.

00:44:01.842 --> 00:44:03.210
But just like everybody else,

00:44:03.282 --> 00:44:04.642
he fooled me too.

00:44:05.301 --> 00:44:07.368
He'll get what's coming to him.

00:44:15.699 --> 00:44:18.327
Hey! You’re all invited to my son’s wedding, okay?

00:44:18.929 --> 00:44:21.055
Oh my, look at my future...

00:44:21.080 --> 00:44:24.318
- daughter-in-law’s beautiful dress! - Dad, this is what Belen still owes us.

00:44:24.441 --> 00:44:25.567
Of course, mom!

00:44:26.978 --> 00:44:28.355
- Here they are. - Liza should be...

00:44:28.379 --> 00:44:31.254
the most beautiful woman on our wedding day.

00:44:31.279 --> 00:44:33.509
Of course she will, son.

00:44:33.592 --> 00:44:34.592
Miguel?

00:44:39.431 --> 00:44:41.478
- Miguel. - Oh, that’s right!

00:44:41.503 --> 00:44:44.120
Come on in. You must be exhausted from the trip.

00:44:44.144 --> 00:44:46.396
Let’s eat, okay?

00:44:46.421 --> 00:44:48.131
- Miguel, I thought— - Let’s go.

00:45:02.526 --> 00:45:04.694
Would you still choose Isla over me?

00:45:08.611 --> 00:45:09.711
Of course, not.

00:45:12.636 --> 00:45:13.762
Are you sure?

00:45:15.180 --> 00:45:16.180
Yes.

00:45:21.922 --> 00:45:23.242
You better mean it.

00:45:24.374 --> 00:45:25.542
You’re prettier than her.

00:45:33.569 --> 00:45:34.653
You taste good.

00:45:38.532 --> 00:45:39.780
You’re mine?

00:45:40.727 --> 00:45:41.727
Yes.

00:45:41.952 --> 00:45:43.162
I’m yours.

00:46:00.095 --> 00:46:01.095
What?

00:46:02.139 --> 00:46:03.586
Feels good?

00:46:08.479 --> 00:46:09.663
You want this?

00:46:09.688 --> 00:46:10.688
Yes!

00:48:25.616 --> 00:48:27.599
Why are you so nice to Isla?

00:48:30.904 --> 00:48:32.322
I feel bad for her.

00:48:32.437 --> 00:48:33.557
No one is looking after her.

00:48:34.333 --> 00:48:35.421
She’s gone astray.

00:48:37.836 --> 00:48:39.463
Don’t tell me you’re jealous.

00:48:41.628 --> 00:48:42.673
Of course, not.

00:48:48.305 --> 00:48:50.182
Isla is our friend.

00:48:52.476 --> 00:48:53.476
And...

00:48:54.520 --> 00:48:56.280
You know, you’re the only one I love, right?

00:54:00.738 --> 00:54:01.864
Roldan?

00:54:05.523 --> 00:54:06.524
Roldan?

00:54:08.291 --> 00:54:09.291
Roldan?

00:54:12.420 --> 00:54:13.505
Roldan.

00:54:19.302 --> 00:54:20.302
Isla.

00:54:20.762 --> 00:54:21.762
Have you been here long?

00:54:26.977 --> 00:54:28.559
Just mention what’s written here.

00:54:28.913 --> 00:54:30.372
They’ll know where to take you.

00:54:31.189 --> 00:54:32.189
What?

00:54:33.219 --> 00:54:34.219
What about you?

00:54:34.270 --> 00:54:35.357
You’re not coming with me?

00:54:35.485 --> 00:54:37.351
I have business to attend here.

00:54:42.701 --> 00:54:43.701
Isla, don’t.

00:54:43.785 --> 00:54:44.785
This is not right.

00:54:45.453 --> 00:54:46.453
Roldan.

00:54:48.665 --> 00:54:49.971
At least...

00:54:50.362 --> 00:54:52.269
Let me repay your kindness.

00:54:52.294 --> 00:54:53.920
Don’t worry. No one will know.

00:54:54.045 --> 00:54:55.045
Isla, no.

00:54:55.422 --> 00:54:56.422
Put your clothes back on.

00:54:57.203 --> 00:54:58.467
I love Lumeng.

00:54:59.050 --> 00:55:00.127
You know that, right?

00:55:00.302 --> 00:55:01.761
I know, Roldan.

00:55:04.055 --> 00:55:06.224
I just want to remember you like this.

00:55:07.775 --> 00:55:09.461
We might not see each other again.

00:55:10.454 --> 00:55:13.415
I will help you because this is the right thing to do.

00:55:14.107 --> 00:55:15.107
Not like this.

00:55:15.567 --> 00:55:16.567
This is wrong.

00:55:20.697 --> 00:55:22.360
Thank you, Roldan.

00:55:25.619 --> 00:55:26.841
Be careful, alright?

00:55:44.427 --> 00:55:46.116
MAY 15, 7:00 AM RED BOAT 3289

00:55:46.141 --> 00:55:47.750
SAY "BAGONG ISLA".

00:56:21.800 --> 00:56:22.800
Where are you going?

00:56:25.303 --> 00:56:26.303
To Lumeng’s.

00:56:27.347 --> 00:56:28.838
Why do you keep on going there?

00:56:29.749 --> 00:56:31.167
If Liza hadn’t told me,

00:56:31.894 --> 00:56:33.894
I never would’ve known you were seeing another man.

00:56:34.271 --> 00:56:35.538
I’m not seeing other men.

00:56:35.772 --> 00:56:36.772
Liar!

00:56:41.486 --> 00:56:42.486
You’re mine.

00:56:45.115 --> 00:56:46.398
You belong to me, Isla.

00:56:50.829 --> 00:56:52.664
You’re gonna make me kill someone…

00:56:52.872 --> 00:56:53.999
Don’t test me.

00:57:34.914 --> 00:57:36.207
You’re out late again.

00:57:38.084 --> 00:57:39.419
This your trash?

00:57:42.380 --> 00:57:44.424
I know what you’ve been doing to Isla, Roldan.

00:57:51.723 --> 00:57:53.850
I know what you’ve been doing to Isla, too.

00:57:53.933 --> 00:57:56.101
Don’t encourage her to go to Manila.

00:57:56.126 --> 00:57:57.711
She’s called Isla for a reason.

00:57:57.854 --> 00:57:59.094
She belongs here on the island.

00:57:59.147 --> 00:58:01.191
Isla’s sick of your disgusting behavior!

00:58:02.326 --> 00:58:03.919
What kind of person does something like that?

00:58:03.943 --> 00:58:04.943
Are you even human?

00:58:06.237 --> 00:58:07.572
Keep this up,

00:58:08.031 --> 00:58:10.450
and I’ll report you to the police myself!

00:58:11.868 --> 00:58:13.708
Don't stick your nose where it doesn't belong.

00:58:17.540 --> 00:58:18.833
You don’t scare me.

00:58:31.679 --> 00:58:33.056
Lumeng!

00:58:33.264 --> 00:58:34.349
Lumeng!

00:58:34.557 --> 00:58:35.990
Lumeng!

00:58:36.434 --> 00:58:37.477
Lumeng!

00:58:37.645 --> 00:58:38.854
Lumeng, it’s Roldan!

00:58:41.859 --> 00:58:45.194
- Something happened to Roldan! - Roldan!

00:58:45.276 --> 00:58:48.696
- Lumeng! It’s Roldan! - Roldan!

00:58:49.199 --> 00:58:51.895
Roldan!

00:58:53.084 --> 00:58:56.222
Oh, God… Roldan!

00:58:58.181 --> 00:59:00.475
Roldan!

00:59:02.371 --> 00:59:10.371
Roldan, no!

00:59:12.983 --> 00:59:14.835
Roldan!

00:59:14.889 --> 00:59:16.850
Roldan, wake up!

00:59:17.559 --> 00:59:19.394
Who did this to you?

00:59:20.633 --> 00:59:24.130
Roldan!

00:59:29.313 --> 00:59:31.120
Roldan!

00:59:31.415 --> 00:59:34.314
Roldan!

00:59:39.668 --> 00:59:41.474
Roldan!

00:59:41.499 --> 00:59:43.449
Who did this to him?

00:59:54.965 --> 00:59:55.965
Roldan!

01:00:07.400 --> 01:00:09.151
I thought you’d forgotten about me.

01:00:09.244 --> 01:00:11.809
Of course, not. Look, I even brought you some gifts.

01:00:12.715 --> 01:00:14.300
I told you, you don’t have to deal with this alone.

01:00:14.324 --> 01:00:15.619
I’m here.

01:00:16.201 --> 01:00:17.452
Me and Lumeng.

01:00:17.619 --> 01:00:20.185
I will help you because this is the right thing to do.

01:00:21.456 --> 01:00:23.333
You’re gonna make me kill someone…

01:00:23.454 --> 01:00:24.789
Don’t test me.

01:00:27.045 --> 01:00:29.698
Roldan!

01:01:10.672 --> 01:01:11.672
What the...

01:01:12.058 --> 01:01:13.378
What the hell are you doing here?

01:01:14.884 --> 01:01:16.764
Miguel, before you go through with this wedding…

01:01:17.929 --> 01:01:19.321
I want to know...

01:01:20.265 --> 01:01:21.641
Did you ever loved me?

01:01:23.268 --> 01:01:24.268
Of course, I did.

01:01:24.530 --> 01:01:25.530
I loved you.

01:01:26.062 --> 01:01:28.345
Will you give me this one last time?

01:01:30.775 --> 01:01:32.373
We could get caught.

01:01:32.443 --> 01:01:33.443
Miguel...

01:01:33.736 --> 01:01:35.330
Isla, I’m getting married.

01:01:41.202 --> 01:01:42.202
Isla!

01:01:43.037 --> 01:01:44.037
Stop.

01:05:24.697 --> 01:05:26.996
Wow, it’s really windy.

01:05:27.646 --> 01:05:28.955
Hey, Anton.

01:05:29.013 --> 01:05:31.474
Hurry up. They need you right here.

01:05:32.266 --> 01:05:34.226
I just need to grab something from the other side.

01:05:41.301 --> 01:05:42.594
Isla, hurry up.

01:05:43.295 --> 01:05:44.915
Someone might find us.

01:05:56.587 --> 01:05:58.367
Help! Someone help!

01:05:58.392 --> 01:06:02.438
Miguel took advantage of me! Help!

01:06:02.463 --> 01:06:04.103
What the hell are you talking about, Isla?

01:06:04.423 --> 01:06:05.507
Isla!

01:06:05.967 --> 01:06:07.134
Isla, get back here!

01:06:07.969 --> 01:06:09.095
Help!

01:06:09.971 --> 01:06:11.138
Mom!

01:06:11.565 --> 01:06:13.852
- Mom, help! - Isla!

01:06:14.105 --> 01:06:17.500
Mom!

01:06:21.458 --> 01:06:24.113
Miguel tried to force himself on me!

01:06:24.154 --> 01:06:25.154
What?

01:06:25.528 --> 01:06:26.696
She’s lying!

01:06:27.311 --> 01:06:28.353
She's lying!

01:06:29.685 --> 01:06:31.103
I didn’t do anything.

01:06:31.409 --> 01:06:32.793
You set me up!

01:06:32.910 --> 01:06:34.333
To get back on me.

01:06:35.454 --> 01:06:37.707
Please, believe me! I’m innocent!

01:06:38.082 --> 01:06:39.082
Love...

01:06:39.458 --> 01:06:41.126
- Is this true? - Please, believe me.

01:06:41.515 --> 01:06:42.848
I didn’t do anything!

01:06:44.005 --> 01:06:45.178
She’s lying to you all!

01:06:46.005 --> 01:06:47.005
Mom!

01:06:47.110 --> 01:06:48.281
Tell us the truth!

01:06:51.220 --> 01:06:52.220
Damn all of you!

01:06:52.264 --> 01:06:54.199
All of you look at me!

01:06:54.922 --> 01:06:56.924
Do I look like I’m lying?

01:06:59.520 --> 01:07:00.533
Love... Love, please!

01:07:01.689 --> 01:07:04.567
Screw you, and this damn wedding!

01:07:05.067 --> 01:07:06.067
Love, wait!

01:07:06.170 --> 01:07:07.653
Love! Liza!

01:07:07.678 --> 01:07:08.678
Miguel!

01:07:10.197 --> 01:07:11.197
Shut your damn mouth!

01:07:11.908 --> 01:07:13.268
I’ve been waiting for this moment.

01:07:13.417 --> 01:07:14.710
You’ve got some nerve!

01:07:16.826 --> 01:07:18.703
You’re the one abusing your own daughter!

01:07:20.541 --> 01:07:22.795
Are you out of your mind? None of that is true!

01:07:23.353 --> 01:07:26.147
No! There’s no way Anton would do such thing.

01:07:26.172 --> 01:07:28.590
Anton would never do that to you, right?

01:07:28.591 --> 01:07:30.509
- He treated you like his own daughter... - Miguel!

01:07:30.533 --> 01:07:31.908
Someone stop them!

01:07:31.940 --> 01:07:34.526
For God’s sake, stop them!

01:07:34.889 --> 01:07:37.850
How many times have I told you, Mom?

01:07:38.434 --> 01:07:40.978
You never listened to me!

01:07:41.038 --> 01:07:42.496
Let go of my son, Anton!

01:07:42.537 --> 01:07:43.664
It’s not true!

01:07:43.689 --> 01:07:47.286
He’s been touching me since I was a little girl, Mom!

01:07:47.782 --> 01:07:48.836
Miguel!

01:07:48.861 --> 01:07:51.155
Why won’t you listen to me, Mom?

01:07:51.197 --> 01:07:52.197
Tell me it isn’t true!

01:07:52.198 --> 01:07:53.950
It’s not true, right, honey?

01:07:53.991 --> 01:07:56.160
You’re just refusing to see the truth!

01:07:58.245 --> 01:07:59.956
You’re only fooling yourself!

01:08:00.623 --> 01:08:01.623
Look!

01:08:02.041 --> 01:08:03.042
Come on! Look!

01:08:03.559 --> 01:08:04.559
Look!

01:08:06.153 --> 01:08:07.487
Please, stop!

01:08:09.382 --> 01:08:10.382
Miguel!

01:08:10.549 --> 01:08:11.592
Look at him!

01:08:12.677 --> 01:08:13.677
Enough!

01:08:16.752 --> 01:08:19.135
Miguel!

01:08:19.392 --> 01:08:21.852
Miguel! My son!

01:08:25.398 --> 01:08:26.705
Help!

01:08:27.101 --> 01:08:29.642
Somebody help!

01:08:29.944 --> 01:08:31.469
My son!

01:08:34.448 --> 01:08:36.550
Roldan knew, didn’t he?

01:08:37.655 --> 01:08:39.407
That’s why you killed him!

01:08:40.579 --> 01:08:41.831
He knew!

01:08:42.102 --> 01:08:44.602
He knew everything you’ve done!

01:08:48.045 --> 01:08:49.797
All the horrible things you’ve done!

01:08:50.798 --> 01:08:53.384
All the times you raped me!

01:09:02.935 --> 01:09:03.935
Hold them back!

01:09:05.354 --> 01:09:06.674
Why? What are you gonna do to me?